  "description": "It’s been 20 years since Hanbin was warped to the Kingdom of Britania. In that time, he’s earned himself fame and power, but there’s one thing he lacks: some good cuisine! He decides to quit his job in the palace as Home Secretary and adopt a new identity as Jurgen, owner of a coffee shop in the city of Northaris. But contrary to his expectations, the espresso he sells is a total flop, so he uses his alchemy to create something this world has never seen... the perfect soft drink, cola! \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
